'' FRAC, INT, FIX, SQR, and ABS/SGN over a float, fold in '#if' (fbc's optimizations/consteval.bas).
'' tiko refused the first four (TKO0308) and read a float's abs/sgn as its rounded integer.
'' Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/pp-math-if.bas -o tests/codegen/ppmathif.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/ppmathif.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: m1 m2 m3 m4 m5 m6 m7 m8 m9 end
